<p><strong>What I can give:</strong> Anything related to photos. Need an original or free to use image or photo of an obscure location or object for one of your articles? I can get you one. I can also offer my help for any article ideas you may need (although probably not with the actual writing of the article&#8230; I kinda suck in that)</p>
<p><strong>What I'm looking for:</strong> My poor only SCP in this site, SCP-4562 had a nice tale written about it last year, which was sadly never posted. This year I'm looking for something similar : someone to expand on the article, either with a tale, a test log, or something similar.</p>

